Disambiguate FileSystems.newFileSystem(path, null) for JDK 13 and later.

JDK 13 added newFileSystem(Path, Map), so a null second argument matches
two overloads and javac rejects the call. The cast picks the ClassLoader
overload, the only one JDK 8 to 12 have.

Upstream: not submitted
Applies-to: all environments

